{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 02 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">稠密预测与医学分割：从像素输出到自配置系统</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Dense Segmentation</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_013_models_genesis-title\">Models Genesis</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">多种 3D 变形与遮挡的统一恢复式自监督，而非从 2D ImageNet 迁移。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Unified restorative 3D self-supervised learning from non-linear intensity, local pixel shuffling, and in-/out-painting perturbations.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">未标注 3D CT 子体积</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Unlabeled 3D CT/MRI sub-volumes</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">可迁移的 3D encoder 表示</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Transferable 3D encoder-decoder representations for segmentation and classification</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 1 · PDF p.3</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始方法示意图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.media.2020.101840\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_013_models_genesis')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_013_models_genesis')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"Models Genesis original paper architecture figure, Figure 1\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/f0c4f62a13b611f9ceca.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 1 · PDF p.3</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 8 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_013_models_genesis', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_013_models_genesis\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_013_models_genesis')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_013_models_genesis', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_013_models_genesis\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 08 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">原始 3D Crop</span><span class=\"lang-en\">3D Crop</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">从 CT 体数据采样含解剖结构的子体积。</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests unlabeled 3d ct/mri sub-volumes and prepares initial tensor representations (3D Crop).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"从 CT 体数据采样含解剖结构的子体积。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests unlabeled 3d ct/mri sub-volumes and prepares initial tensor representations (3D Crop).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"原始 3D Crop\" data-node-name-en=\"3D Crop\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_013_models_genesis', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">原始 3D Crop</span><span class=\"lang-en\">3D Crop</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">从 CT 体数据采样含解剖结构的子体积。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests unlabeled 3d ct/mri sub-volumes and prepares initial tensor representations (3D Crop).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"对强度施加非线性变换，迫使模型恢复组织对比。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes Nonlinear Warp to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"Nonlinear Warp\" data-node-name-en=\"Nonlinear Warp\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_013_models_genesis', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Nonlinear Warp</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">对强度施加非线性变换，迫使模型恢复组织对比。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes Nonlinear Warp to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"局部像素重排破坏纹理但保留粗空间布局。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Local Shuffle within the core restorative 3d self supervision computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"Local Shuffle\" data-node-name-en=\"Local Shuffle\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_013_models_genesis', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Local Shuffle</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">局部像素重排破坏纹理但保留粗空间布局。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Local Shuffle within the core restorative 3d self supervision computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"内部或外部 cutout 移除区域，要求利用上下文补全。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs In/Out-paint within the core restorative 3d self supervision computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"In/Out-paint\" data-node-name-en=\"In/Out-paint\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_013_models_genesis', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>In/Out-paint</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">内部或外部 cutout 移除区域，要求利用上下文补全。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs In/Out-paint within the core restorative 3d self supervision computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"共享卷积编码器从受损体数据提取解剖表示。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs 3D Encoder within the core restorative 3d self supervision computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"3D Encoder\" data-node-name-en=\"3D Encoder\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_013_models_genesis', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>3D Encoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">共享卷积编码器从受损体数据提取解剖表示。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs 3D Encoder within the core restorative 3d self supervision computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"恢复原始子体积的形状、纹理和强度。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs 3D Decoder within the core restorative 3d self supervision computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"3D Decoder\" data-node-name-en=\"3D Decoder\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_013_models_genesis', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>3D Decoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">恢复原始子体积的形状、纹理和强度。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs 3D Decoder within the core restorative 3d self supervision computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"预测干净体数据并与原始 crop 比较重建误差。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies objective to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"恢复目标\" data-node-name-en=\"objective\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_013_models_genesis', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">恢复目标</span><span class=\"lang-en\">objective</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">预测干净体数据并与原始 crop 比较重建误差。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies objective to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"丢弃恢复 decoder，将 encoder 初始化到分类或分割任务。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces transferable 3d encoder-decoder representations for segmentation and classification via Encoder.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"迁移 Encoder\" data-node-name-en=\"Encoder\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_013_models_genesis', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">迁移 Encoder</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Encoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">丢弃恢复 decoder，将 encoder 初始化到分类或分割任务。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces transferable 3d encoder-decoder representations for segmentation and classification via Encoder.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"Models Genesis Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · 从多种三维扰动恢复原体积</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Restorative 3D Autoencoding Across Composite Volumetric Corruptions</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"Models Genesis：核心公式 · 从多种三维扰动恢复原体积\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"13\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"9.654267pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.742477 -69.064245 137.149765 9.654267\" width=\"137.149765pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M5.697191-2.272921V-2.828745H.615376V-2.272921H5.697191Z\" id=\"m013_g5-0\"></path><path d=\"M7.364661-.665003L7.315034-.764257C6.888241-.297763 6.26294 0 5.627713 0C4.545842 0 3.503673-.327539 2.47143-.595525C3.5533-1.558291 4.168676-2.650087 4.406886-4.079348C4.525991-4.823754 4.635171-6.511075 5.67734-6.511075C6.114059-6.511075 6.491225-6.352269 6.491225-5.855998C6.491225-5.657489 6.39197-5.468906 6.253014-5.32995V-5.220771C6.491225-5.300174 7.265407-5.657489 7.265407-5.945326C7.265407-6.580553 6.441597-6.838614 5.925476-6.838614C3.215836-6.838614 3.384568-4.02972 2.858521-2.133965C2.769192-1.796501 2.302697-.744406 1.895755-.744406C1.617843-.744406 1.349857-.853586 1.071945-.853586C.704705-.853586 .208434-.12903 .069478 .168732L.119105 .23821C.287837 .099254 .535973-.059553 .764