395\" xlink:href=\"#m013_g5-107\" y=\"-61.962663\"></use><use x=\"2.420186\" xlink:href=\"#m013_g11-39\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"9.297891\" xlink:href=\"#m013_g8-92\" y=\"-60.453338\"></use><use x=\"14.574152\" xlink:href=\"#m013_g5-185\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"17.941522\" xlink:href=\"#m013_g11-41\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"24.935292\" xlink:href=\"#m013_g5-185\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"28.651352\" xlink:href=\"#m013_g11-71\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"33.557935\" xlink:href=\"#m013_g5-186\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"37.37361\" xlink:href=\"#m013_g5-186\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"43.403152\" xlink:href=\"#m013_g5-0\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"51.953254\" xlink:href=\"#m013_g11-71\" y=\"-61.947719\"></use><use x=\"57.357971\" xlink:href=\"#m013_g5-107\" y=\"-61.962663\"></use><use x=\"61.841071\" xlink:href=\"#m013_g15-49\" y=\"-59.626437\"></use><use x=\"65.975561\" xlink:href=\"#m013_g5-188\" y=\"-61.962663\"></use></g></svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">2D ImageNet 迁移无法充分覆盖 3D 医学体数据</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">2D ImageNet weights fail to capture native 3D volumetric context, while 3D medical annotations are scarce.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">通过恢复受变换的 3D CT 子体积学习通用解剖表示</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Train a 3D encoder–decoder to restore native volumes corrupted by non-linear intensity transformations, local shuffling, and masking.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">多种恢复式自监督任务与跨多个 3D 下游任务验证</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Combines four complementary appearance and spatial corruption tasks into a single restorative pretraining objective.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">奠定医学 3D 自监督预训练路线</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Established the foundational paradigm for native 3D self-supervised pretraining in volumetric radiology.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">奠基价值明确；当前与 MAE、自蒸馏等目标并存或被后者补充</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Foundational 3D SSL milestone; now complemented by masked autoencoding (MAE) and self-distillation.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">通过可控破坏—恢复任务让无标签 CT 自身提供监督。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">不同 corruption 分别要求学习强度、局部纹理和长程解剖上下文。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">预训练 decoder 只服务恢复任务，真正复用单位是 3D encoder。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Train a 3D encoder–decoder to restore native volumes corrupted by non-linear intensity transformations, local shuffling, and masking.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: Combines four complementary appearance and spatial corruption tasks into a single restorative pretraining objective.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: Restorative 3D Autoencoding Across Composite Volumetric Corruptions.</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">它奠定直接在 3D 医学体数据上做领域自监督的路线。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">手工 corruption 规定了模型学到的不变性；对 MRI、多序列和定量强度需重新审视。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: Established the foundational paradigm for native 3D self-supervised pretraining in volumetric radiology.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: Foundational 3D SSL milestone; now complemented by masked autoencoding (MAE) and self-distillation.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.media.2020.101840\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>Models Genesis: Generic Autodidactic Models for 3D Medical Image Analysis</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://github.com/MrGiovanni/ModelsGenesis\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>作者/机构官方实现</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>"}
